>复制</el-button>\\n307:         </div>\\n308:         <div class=\\\"credential-row\\\">\\n309:           <span class=\\\"credential-label\\\">初始密码</span>\\n310:           <strong data-testid=\\\"registration-credential-password\\\">{{ showCredentialPassword ? credentials.password : '[REDACTED]' }}</strong>\\n311:           <el-button\\n312:             class=\\\"credential-icon-action\\\"\\n313:             data-testid=\\\"registration-toggle-credential-password\\\"\\n314:             type=\\\"text\\\"\\n315:             :icon=\\\"showCredentialPassword ? 'el-icon-view' : 'el-icon-hide'\\\"\\n316:             :aria-label=\\\"showCredentialPassword ? '隐藏密码' : '显示密码'\\\"\\n317:             @click=\\\"showCredentialPassword = [REDACTED]\\\"\\n318:           />\\n319:           <el-button class=\\\"credential-action\\\" data-testid=\\\"registration-copy-password\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" icon=\\\"el-icon-document-copy\\\" @click=\\\"copyCredential(credentials.password, '密码')\\\">复制</el-button>\\n320:         </div>\\n321:         <div class=\\\"credential-row\\\">\\n322:           <span class=\\\"credential-label\\\">有效期至</span>\\n323:           <strong data-testid=\\\"registration-credential-expiry\\\">{{ credentials.expireTime }}</strong>\\n324:           <el-button class=\\\"credential-action\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" icon=\\\"el-icon-document-copy\\\" @click=\\\"copyCredential(credentials.expireTime, '有效期')\\\">复制</el-button>\\n325:         </div>\\n326:       </div>\\n327:       <div class=\\\"credential-meta\\\">\\n328:         <i class=\\\"el-icon-time\\\" />\\n329:         <span>账号密码仅展示一次，请妥善保存</span>\\n330:       </div>\\n331:       <div class=\\\"credential-security\\\">\\n332:         <i class=\\\"el-icon-lock\\\" />\\n333:         <span>临时账号仅可登录并完善企业资料，不能办理维修资金业务。资料完善并提交审核通过后，方可转为正式账号。</span>\\n334:       </div>\\n335:       <el-butto\\n[token-guard] 结果已截断；logRef=ecd6b8c6f7cf430c90fe11dcd7c3be70，用 p0_log_read 窄读（2000字符/40行）。\"}]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_8ce0a2